    "detailed_description": "Springy: A Bounce Adventure is a Brazilian adventure and platform game set in the world of a cute little ball named Springy. Springy is a very kind and brave creature who is always willing to help his friends while trying to keep everything around him in perfect balance.<br><br><strong>Fully 3D Game:</strong><br>Play with Springy in a fully 3D world with different challenges, difficulties, traps and find out who is responsible for all the odds.<br><br><strong>Visual Cartoon Low Poly:</strong><br>Enjoy the low poly cartoon look, with environments and objects rich in colors and simple details that make the game enjoyable to play.<br><br><strong>Help Your Friends:</strong><br>Interact with friendly characters and help them solve their problems, don't forget they also give you valuable tips.<br><br><strong>Remember Classics:</strong><br>Springy: A Bounce Adventure is based on classic games like Mario 64, Banjo-Kazooie, Crash Bandicoot, Bounce Boing Voyage, Bounce Touch and others.<br><br><strong>What's Included in the Game:</strong><br>The complete project initially has a quantity of 20 stages, with a huge possibility of extending to 30 stages depending on the acceptance of the game by the public.<br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785230/extras/f1dfe134171513bebfbc84b1443221e5.poster.avif?t=1704645386\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785230/extras/f1dfe134171513bebfbc84b1443221e5.webm?t=1704645386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785230/extras/f1dfe134171513bebfbc84b1443221e5.mp4?t=1704645386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Thank you very much for participating in this new experience, without you this project would not be possible. <br><br>Have a good game!!!",
